      "content": "tacetamol (tylenol) isn't really working well enough for this kind of inflammation though. if i just take a slightly higher dose of the advil, like 400mg or 600mg once in a while just to get through the night, would that be okay? i don't think one dose is gonna trigger a major bleeding issue or anything serious like that, right?",
